                  <th style="padding: 16px; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 800; width: 30%;">核心适用群体与场景</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: background-color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#f1f5f9'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='transparent'">
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;">月付常规流媒体套餐</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #0369a1;">¥12.00 ~ ¥70.00 <span style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;">/ 月</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #334155;">168G ~ 1024G/月</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #334155;">自有机房多地接入<br/><span style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#64748b;">(最多支持 5个公网IP)</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem;">绝对的销量主力！12元/168G 的基础包性价比极高。原生解锁全平台 AI 与 Netflix/Disney 流媒体。</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background-color: #fdf4ff; transition: background-color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#fae8ff'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#fdf4ff'">
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #86198f;">传家宝：不限时流量包 👑</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #701a75;">¥65.00 ~ ¥260.00 <span style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;">/ 一次性</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #334155;">188G ~ 1024G</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #92400e;">流量永久不过期<br/><span style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#64748b;">(按流量计费，用完即止)</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem;">备胎防失联神器！对于偶尔查资料的用户，买一个 82元/240G 的流量包能用一整年，不浪费一分钱！</td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background-color: #f0fdf4; transition: background-color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='#dcfce7'" onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='#f0fdf4'">
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #166534;">IEPL 企业专线套餐 (季付起)</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #15803d;">¥52.00 ~ ¥88.00 <span style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #64748b; font-weight: normal;">/ 季付</span></td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #334155;">50G ~ 100G/月</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #166534;">🚀 纯物理 IEPL 专线</td>
                  <td style="padding: 16px; color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem;">硬核玩家与外贸专属！全链路不过墙，深度优化电竞延迟（低至 20ms），跨境贸易防封首选。</td>
